  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0097_beed9c5106cb.png\" style=\"width: 369px; height: 155px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p>"
